OL,3,CProgramme listings for THU 27 NOV
OL,4,G1900FClassical Mixtape
OL,5,     GTake time out with a 30-minute
OL,6,     Gsoundscape of classical music,
OL,7,     Gincluding a motet by Bruckner and
OL,8,     GVenus from Holst's The Planets.
OL,9,G1930FRadio 3 in Concert
OL,10,     GThe RLPO and Alpesh Chauhan
OL,11,     Gpresent a concert inspired by the
OL,12,     Gspirit of dance from the
OL,13,     Gorchestra's home in Liverpool
OL,14,     Gincluding music by Copland,
OL,15,     GBritten, Simon and Ravel.
OL,16,G2145FThe Essay: Watching from the Wings
OL,17,     GMichael Goldfarb remembers his
OL,18,     Gtheatrical life as an actor. In
OL,19,     Gthis episode, he recalls a
OL,20,     Glifelong admiration for John
OL,21,     GGielgud and how he once met him
OL,22,     Gat the theatre door.
